eates waste of context. Everything is turned into a lesson so that it's not wasted, and we adapt to the model. It's training, it's guide rails, and however they control the models to not respond to some things or to take action if some things are asked.\n/home/li/wt/primary/mind-sol-successor-56ae53-target/AGENTS.md:51:-- psyche, STT, 2026-09-14, `flows/6cc91b/vision/privateLayer.md`.\n/home/li/wt/primary/mind-sol-successor-56ae53-target/firstmate-bridge/AGENTS.md:24:- Return genuine decisions, authority, privacy, safety, or blockers through the\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
