 FlowId HerdrPaneId PresentationObservedUnixMilliseconds }`; the marker\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:331:real Claude Start (successor 88475f, launched through 0.10.5):\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:333:- A receipt that arrives after `StartAmbiguous` now promotes the launch with\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:334:  no subscriber and no second Start. The Nexus runs its own watch over every\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:335:  ambiguous launch (on startup too, so a launch left ambiguous by an older\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:338:- The Claude receipt observer stops checking once the first turn and every\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:344:- A Herdr route is keyed on the session, pane id and terminal id. The agent\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:345:  name is re-read from the snapshot (ResolveRecipient, Send and Stop report\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:358:A patch release with no wire, storage or argv-shape change. The Herdr route\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:362:  before) is routable when its Herdr `agent_status` is `idle`, `done` or\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:364:  `idle` or `done`. Herdr 0.8.2 reports a harness at rest after a turn as\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:366:- `interactive_ready` gates the route only when Herdr reports it: an absent\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:367:  (or null) flag permits, `true` permits, any other value refuses. Herdr 0.8.2\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:382:  outcome is stored, or when the Flow the launch bound is stopped (`Stop`, or\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:383:  the reap of a `Replace`). A Started Flow keeps its copy while it runs.\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:394:per launch. At Start the Nexus writes each Claude launch its own copy of the\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:400:bundle is never edited. A copy that cannot be written refuses Start as\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:406:Herdr from an absent pane. A failed or roster-less snapshot of the\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:425:  Start answers as `CompositionRefused`.\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:434:predecessor whose pane is already gone from Herdr as already reaped: the\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:435:predecessor is recorded `Stopped`, `Replaced` is recorded, and the successor\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:453:- Start sets the canonical native title `<Aspect>V2.{ <Model> <FlowId> }`\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:454:  and the Herdr pane label after the claim and reads both back before any\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:456:  model-display map; an unmapped model refuses the Start (`BindingRefused`).\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:459:- Claude starts with `--settings '{\\\"permissions\\\":{\\\"defaultMode\\\":\\\"bypassPermissions\\\"}}'`,\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:468:  is recorded `Stopped` and its pane closed before the successor is routable.\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:472:- `ResolveRecipient` now refuses a `Stopped` flow with `FlowUnavailable`.\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:476:  and `FLOW_CODEX_*` deployment overrides still apply at start.\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:498:A fresh Flow now receives one prompt. The native harness starts with no\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:499:positional startup block; the composed first prompt carries the native skill\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:UPGRADES.md:522:Flow st