ent> <herdr-pane> <herdr-terminal> [endpoint] | flow-meta '<one inline meta Query datom>'\\\".into()),\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:crates/flow-meta/src/main.rs:115:        \\\"usage: flow-meta register-codex|register-claude <flow-id> <session-id> <herdr-session> <herdr-agent> <herdr-pane> <herdr-terminal> [endpoint]\\\".into()\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:crates/flow-meta/src/main.rs:167:                [\\\"Configure.{ /run/user/1001/flow/flow.sock /run/user/1001/flow/flow-meta.sock /home/li/primary { /etc/profiles/per-user/li/bin/codex-stable-flow-client /home/li/.codex /home/li/.codex/app-server-control/app-server-control.sock [ gpt-5.6-terra gpt-5.6-sol gpt-5.6-luna ] } { /etc/profiles/per-user/li/bin/codex-next-flow-client /home/li/.codex-next /home/li/.codex-next/app-server-control/app-server-control.sock [ gpt-6-sol gpt-6-luna gpt-6-astra ] } [ { Claude [ / «!» # ] [ esc esc ] [ enter ] } { Codex [ / «!» ] [ esc ] [] } ] [ Psyche ] /etc/profiles/per-user/li/bin/message-nexus }\\\".into()]\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:crates/flow-meta/src/main.rs:199:    fn deliver_is_one_inline_datom_carrying_a_typed_message() {\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:crates/flow-meta/src/main.rs:215:            request.message,\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:crates/flow-meta/src/main.rs:216:            meta_signal_flow::Message::Soft(_)\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:crates/flow-meta/src/main.rs:236:    fn registration_carries_the_complete_herdr_binding() {\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:crates/flow-meta/src/main.rs:259:            node.herdr_route_selection,\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:crates/flow-meta/src/main.rs:260:            signal_flow::HerdrRouteSelection::Available(signal_flow::HerdrRoute {\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69fc5:crates/flow-meta/src/main.rs:261:                herdr_session_name: \\\"messaging-build\\\".into(),\\nbc464e5e1b94fcc179af73111f43b69db1f69